<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Springs Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Springs Industries.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cut its rating on Springs Industries Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down four at 42-3/4.</p>
</text>
